\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces {\fontencoding  {T1}\fontseries  {b}\selectfont  {I}mage Counts Contributed by Each Source (v5 Splits)}}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
